{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "4379f07e6cf0b6d2397da0c2700fcb28d0742f9c32632f676ee7ec35bfcc01bf", "ja": "怪しいプロデューサーではありません", "zh": "我不是可疑的制作人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1366d3b0585b62d08fe136ae6abb0554d72784b84f07fe1eb7653662377a9f39", "ja": "響と伊織に、盗撮でもしているんじゃないか\nと、疑いの目を向けられてしまったプロデュ\nーサー。説明して無事納得してもらい、その\n後もひなたや育の姿を撮り続けるのだった。", "zh": "制作人被响和伊织怀疑是不是在偷拍。解释清楚后，终于顺利让她们相信了，之后也继续拍摄日向和育的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "9f082485489b1d3257cfb1f50495f066ad558d09223a1a47a8fc2024d712c92a", "ja": "ドキュメンタリーVTRの撮影？　なるほどね！\nそれって、そのためのカメラだったんだ！", "zh": "拍纪录片VTR？原来如此！\n难怪你带着那台摄像机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "a9ef9141fa35600f1b92932140791274f4320c4bef9d0a8873c51c431d56c52e", "ja": "ふふん、安心したわ。\n何かよからぬものを撮影しようとしてたんじゃなくて。", "zh": "哼哼，这下我就放心了。\n原来不是要拍什么不该拍的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "c62b76bd9e7b46d8baba5c46436895f0de9934c4642f7254d32b4333d265c984", "ja": "確かに、ちょっと怪しかったぞ。\nいぬ美も警戒してたし。", "zh": "确实，当时看起来有点可疑呢。\n犬美也在警戒着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "b03f610c283f005f3a4c48c1b28dcc59663afc09ab4426295550f93b98299d8b", "ja": "日頃の行いよね～。\nギリギリ通報されなくてよかったわね！", "zh": "这都是平时的行为举止决定的嘛～。\n还好差一点就被举报了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "02920ca8c2825db466cfb5e43cbcdb364c632ea7d1b6eb5344e0c77ec42b1eb3", "ja": "ところでアンタ、わかってると思うけど、ここは\nカットね？　ファン用の顔ってもんがあるんだから！", "zh": "不过话说回来，你应该明白吧，这段要剪掉哦？毕竟还得顾及在粉丝面前的形象嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1005_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "920d7c640387859f1b110bb00a71de81fefbbf70bffcbca066e668fc75e69156", "ja": "はーい♪　それはもちろん、この私。\n世界的スーパーアイドル、水瀬伊織ちゃんそのものよ！", "zh": "好——♪那当然就是我啦。\n世界级超级偶像，水濑伊织本人哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "510f9f365d078705e7e239d5d2017870ed7189ab6cabfe550a98524d3f28f86b", "ja": "これからも私のこと、全身全霊で応援してね？\nよろしくお願いしまーす！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "今后也要全心全意支持我哦？\n拜托啦——！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "654f380b54113eb4add9220290926c79f3c023259ea1b855f56e470c06b32694", "ja": "自分はなんだろう……。自分にとっていちばん\n輝いてるものっていったら、沖縄の太陽なんだよね。", "zh": "要说我最喜欢、最耀眼的东西是什么……那就是冲绳的太阳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "9da973ff16cf9b06e25b784c3a388a93449dc83df565eaae552db917bd2533b5", "ja": "だから自分も、あの太陽に負けないつもりで頑張るぞ！\nどんなステージも、お仕事も、なんくるないさー！", "zh": "所以我也要以不输给那太阳的决心加油！  \n不管是什么舞台、什么工作，总会有办法的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "c0590a39a5bfb3da04891fddd360cbc8aee34e7c59ac3fe5f9fa7e436842bbcf", "ja": "んしょ……。\n……うん、ピカピカになったべさ！", "zh": "哟咻……。\n……嗯，洗得亮晶晶的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "df1fa1679735a36896d83b56a88d7d72c452caf1f3fc4fb5499edf67da2c8f5f", "ja": "劇場のアイドルのひとり、木下ひなたさん。\nいつもこうして、洗い物をしてくれているとか？", "zh": "剧场的偶像之一，木下日向。听说她总是像这样帮忙洗碗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "8be559384543701fbffc2c1cf8d152c4be79731e7fb5096438ceab7c7a206eef", "ja": "いつもじゃないよぉ。あたしがやることもあれば、\n誰かがやってくれることもあって、お互い様でしょや。", "zh": "也不是一直都这样啦。有时是我来洗，\n有时是别人来洗，大家都是互相帮忙嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1013_null", "source_sha256": "17f73a32706b64273bc523977192d7bec1a94417f6d7b312c233ccf09517b909", "ja": "でも、助かっているという声が多いみたいですよ。", "zh": "不过，似乎有很多人表示这帮了他们大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "2a2284a088d164ac62a9e646b34071d5058435613e8be2e31a828acae869f69c", "ja": "なんもなんも！　えへへ……♪\nこんなとこ見られちゃって、なまら恥ずかしいべさ。", "zh": "没事没事！嘿嘿……♪\n居然被看到这样的地方，真是怪不好意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1015_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "1919e83d0450c0046f243a0ea9d6a4626183e07401e00826af175e0ce8f95dd8", "ja": "あたしには、何も自慢できることはないけれども……\nそれでも応援してくれる人はいるんだよねえ。", "zh": "我虽然没有什么值得自豪的地方……\n但还是有人愿意为我加油呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "16150d9f5d1351a90783b1d6aaf5534c3288b8b3c36befe53973e3fc90659c00", "ja": "だから、少しでもお返ししたいって思ってるんだわ。\nええと……これで答えになってるだろか？", "zh": "所以，我想哪怕只有一点点，也要回报他们。  \n那个……这样算是回答了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "04920c01acbab6d8b9cfd3c935780ceacdcc0a986a6eee1f5a586d0987e56ad5", "ja": "ごちそうさま♪　うん、今はね、\nお仕事の間に、ご飯を食べてたところ！", "zh": "多谢款待♪嗯，我刚才正在工作间隙吃饭呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "b688796d7179f1135d9b933783d05aaae4c2bc56d1954fb12120df5c63af07e0", "ja": "休み時間は、もう少しあるけど……。\nカメラで何かするの？", "zh": "休息时间还剩一会儿……  \n要用相机做什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1020_null", "source_sha256": "cc1e1ecafae450ac501a109625ca50fed483df214a37ead2e7623a163fe547a0", "ja": "実は、やって欲しいことがあって。", "zh": "其实，有件事想让你去做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "303f45267f244a8583ce4d41d3cc298c1189af01a674757f3d5506a3320c0532", "ja": "自分の輝いてるところを、アイドルのみんなに\n聞いてるの？　ふーん、そうなんだ。", "zh": "你在问偶像们自己身上闪闪发光的地方吗？哦——这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "c3d7911c74a262f00c56a8a8ff3d8c84c20a8c7befab767e00dc3421fee9aa35", "ja": "うん、面白そう！　わたしも答えたい！", "zh": "嗯，听起来很有意思！我也想回答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1023_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "844e69caaafbf02a63a4d09021393d307cfa46f894c260b75d8025f8bd16a940", "ja": "あのね、今は……子どもだっていうことだと思う。\n子どもなのにすごい、えらいってほめられるから。", "zh": "那个，我觉得现在……就是身为孩子这一点吧。\n因为明明还是个孩子，却会被夸奖很厉害、很了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_04_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "49b0ffaf9caf962614b7e5d9f4c0b8794bce57ab12f2135a8314d366ec66a95c", "ja": "でもそれだけだと、いつか通用しなくなっちゃうよね？\nわたしだけの輝き、これから探していきたいな！", "zh": "不过光靠这个，总有一天会行不通的吧？\n我想从今以后去寻找只属于自己的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
